@startuml SD_09
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1F2933
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1F2933
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3F5F7
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #8A929A
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
hide footbox

title SD-09 Summarise completed reservations
actor "Staff" as a
participant "ui :\nQueryView" as v <<boundary>>
participant "flow :\nQueryControl" as f <<control>>
participant "user :\nTestIdentity" as u <<entity>>
participant "records :\nReservationSet" as r <<entity>>
autonumber
a -> v: open summary
v -> f: request totals
f -> u: checkRole
u --> f: staff / denied
break role denied
f --> v: access error
v --> a: show error
end
f -> r: read Completed
r --> f: records / error
alt read succeeded
f -> f: sum q and q*p
f --> v: copies, amount
else read failed
f --> v: read error
end
v --> a: show result
note over a,r
Use saved p; exclude Pending collection and Cancelled. An empty set gives 0 and 0.00.
Totals cover BookBridge records, not verified payment revenue. No reporting-period filter.
end note
@enduml
